e","760f108e2ef5",[210],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":211,"_205":212},[],"Energy-efficient construction","a00f89e4525c",[216],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":217,"_205":218},[],"Luxury bathrooms with designer fixtures","d29b517b5931",[222],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":223,"_205":224},[],"High ceilings and expansive glazing","4dc16c01bf0d",[228],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":229,"_205":230},[],"Premium natural stone finishes","8e37c2302111",[234],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":235,"_205":236},[],"Custom-designed joinery throughout","46f2efb85ac5",[240],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":241,"_205":242},[],"Designer kitchen with premium appliances","df89c3404ecf",[246],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":247,"_205":248},[],"Open-plan kitchen, living and dining","4a3267b6798d",[252],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":253,"_205":254},[],"Premium architectural façade","7f860b5a529a",[258],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":259,"_205":260},[],"Architecturally designed contemporary home","5ac407ef52f1",[264],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":265,"_205":266},[],"Built on a 300sqm inner-city allotment","7a4121cab82c",[270],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":271,"_205":272},[],"Approximately 335sqm (36 Squares) custom residence","1ca9cd236cca",[277],[],"h3",{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":278,"_205":279},[],"Key Features","8ba20743643c",[283],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":284,"_205":285},[],"Every aspect of the home has been carefully considered to deliver a residence that is both functional and visually striking, demonstrating our commitment to quality and innovation.","9461264a2d82",[289],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":290,"_205":291},[],"Siari Build managed the project from planning through to construction, coordinating every stage to ensure a seamless building process. By combining intelligent design, efficient site management and exceptional craftsmanship, the project maximises every square metre of the allotment while creating spacious, light-filled living areas and a premium architectural finish.","069ec55841ed",[295],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":296,"_205":297},[],"Our Solution","fee527c28b83",[301],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":302,"_205":303},[],"Managing planning approvals, demolition, engineering, protection works and construction sequencing while maintaining safety, quality and efficiency required strong project management and close coordination with consultants, authorities and trades.","81d15e42d8b7",[307],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":308,"_205":309},[],"Constructing a luxury custom home within Melbourne’s inner-city environment presented a unique set of challenges. The compact 300sqm site, close proximity to neighbouring properties, restricted access and extensive council requirements demanded meticulous planning before construction could commence.","9ae5de5ebb23",[313],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":314,"_205":315},[],"The Challenge","9312f000e9b5",[319],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":320,"_205":321},[],"Located in one of Melbourne’s most established suburbs, this project reflects Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality custom homes on challenging urban sites where careful planning, precision and attention to detail are essential.","48b27a3a1a57",[325],[],{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":326,"_205":327},[],"The Collingwood Residence is a bespoke 36-square architecturally designed custom home currently under construction on a 300sqm inner-city allotment. Designed to maximise space, natural light and modern family living, the residence combines contemporary architecture with premium finishes and exceptional craftsmanship.","ce610f70c49f",[332],[],"h2",{"_186":201,"_188":202,"_203":333,"_205":334},[],"Overview",{"_336":337,"_338":339,"_340":341,"_342":343},"settings",{"_402":403,"_342":-5,"_404":405,"_406":407,"_408":409,"_410":-5,"_411":111,"_412":413,"_414":-5,"_415":416,"_417":365,"_418":-5,"_419":-5,"_420":365,"_421":422,"_423":424,"_425":426,"_427":428,"_429":-5,"_430":431,"_432":433,"_138":434,"_435":436,"_437":438},"navigation",{"_362":363,"_364":365,"_366":367,"_368":369},"services",[344,345,346,347,348,349],"businessPhoto","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/650dd2357c41a87e224539f92b3bd25147c59175-3500x2333.jpg",{"_205":360,"_30":361},{"_205":358,"_30":359},{"_205":356,"_30":357},{"_205":354,"_30":355},{"_205":352,"_30":353},{"_205":350,"_30":351},"Extra space for family, guests or rental income - designed and built properly, not bolted on.","Granny Flats","From a single kitchen to a whole-home transformation - old bones, new life.","Renovations","More room without the move. Ground-floor and second-storey extensions that look like they were always there.","Extensions & Additions","Dual occupancies and townhouses that get the most out of your site — and your return.","Multi-Dwelling Developments","Already have plans or an architect? We build to your design with the rigour it deserves.","Bespoke Builds","Architecturally led homes built around how you actually live — not a catalogue floor plan.","Custom Homes","footerMenu",[391,392,393,394,395,396],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[376,377,378,379],"socialMenu",[370],{"_371":-5,"_372":-5,"_373":374,"_150":375},"hideFromMenu","icon","label","Instagram","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_373":-5,"_381":389,"_383":390},{"_373":-5,"_381":387,"_383":388},{"_373":-5,"_381":385,"_383":386},{"_373":380,"_381":382,"_383":384},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_373":-5,"_381":389,"_383":390},{"_373":-5,"_381":387,"_383":388},{"_373":-5,"_381":385,"_383":386},{"_373":-5,"_381":382,"_383":384},{"_373":399,"_381":400,"_383":401},{"_373":-5,"_381":397,"_383":398},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","FAQ","faq","Frequently Asked Questions","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","logo",